      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MINTER MULWEE (2) showed good speed off a low draw and there throughout but run over late when 6th over 400m at this track in a Grade 4/5. Has performed well from this box with a win and two minor placings to his name from six starts. Can discover winning form. MERRY MYRTLE (5) comes off an average run last start when sixth at Gosford over 388m behind Tarawi Rex (23.13) in a Grade 5. The form out of her last race has been franked. Has ability and a bold showing is expected. BRING ON BLING (7) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing sixth (23.42) in a Grade 5 at this track. Solid record here winning two races. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings five times from eight attempts. A big run wouldn't surprise. ARCTIC FLASH (4) warrants respect with the drop in journey.",
